-# dane-community-2 from branding/brand.ftl; this en-US string is kept in sync.
-community-2 = { -brand-short-name } is built from Mozilla's open source Firefox ESR web browser. { -brand-short-name } is not officially associated with Mozilla or its products. <label data-l10n-name="community-mozillaLink">Mozilla</label> is a <label data-l10n-name="community-creditsLink">global community</label> working together to keep the Web open, public and accessible to all.
+community-2 = { -brand-short-name } is designed by <label data-l10n-name="community-mozillaLink">{ -vendor-short-name }</label>, a <label data-l10n-name="community-creditsLink">global community</label> working together to keep the Web open, public and accessible to all.
 
 helpus = Want to help? <label data-l10n-name="helpus-donateLink">Make a donation</label> or <label data-l10n-name="helpus-getInvolvedLink">get involved!</label>
 
